{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And we said to my lord.</b> We concealed nothing from you (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>And his brother is dead.</b> Out of fear he would utter a falsehood from his mouth — he said: if I tell him that he is alive, he will say, bring him to me." "<b>Alone to his mother.</b> From that same mother he has no other brother."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:29.294447502Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}